{"version":1,"content":"<p>任賢齊（小齊）相隔15年，終於重返紅館開演唱會！</p><p>日前他在澳門舉行《齊跡2026》巡迴演唱會，面對數百名香港歌迷高舉「下一站紅磡」應援牌，終於親口宣布好消息：「我申請到明年2027年4月17、18日嘅檔期啦！</p><p>」</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T07:18:06.209149+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":106,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T06:45:47+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T12:38:16.914853+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T07:18:06.209149+00:00","content_hash":"56f92630309579b2d61389be87174f48e6dba1cdf8d867d92701bc3deae0763c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}